#: ../../concepts/field-error-metric.md:1
msgid "概念：场误差指标"
msgstr "Concept: Field-error metric"

#: ../../concepts/field-error-metric.md:3
msgid "环境用**一个**加权矢量均方根值衡量残差场。对残差矢量 `r_i` 和正权重 `w_i`："
msgstr "The environment measures the residual field with **one** weighted vector root-mean-square value. For residual vectors `r_i` and positive weights `w_i`:"

#: ../../concepts/field-error-metric.md:9
msgid "几点必须理解："
msgstr "Points to understand:"

#: ../../concepts/field-error-metric.md:11
msgid "这是对点做矢量模长的 RMS，不是对 `3N` 个标量分量做 RMS。"
msgstr "This is a vector-magnitude RMS over points, not an RMS over the `3N` scalar components."

#: ../../concepts/field-error-metric.md:12
msgid "所有权重乘以同一个正常数，指标不变；相对权重才有意义。"
msgstr "Scaling all weights by the same positive constant leaves the metric unchanged; relative weights are what matter."

#: ../../concepts/field-error-metric.md:13
msgid "奖励里的 `field_threshold_t`、`field_scale_t` 和 `field_weight` 都作用在这个单一指标上。"
msgstr "`field_threshold_t`, `field_scale_t`, and `field_weight` in the reward all act on this single metric."

#: ../../concepts/field-error-metric.md:14
msgid "权重来自点集；均匀评估时所有权重取 1。"
msgstr "Weights come from the point set; use 1 everywhere for uniform evaluation."

#: ../../concepts/field-error-metric.md:16
msgid "指标定义在[格式契约](../reference/format-contracts)里与打包布局一起冻结，改变它需要新的 ADR 和契约测试。"
msgstr "The metric is frozen in [Reference: format contracts](../reference/format-contracts) together with the package layout; changing it requires a new ADR and contract tests."
